{"id": "DfUr7vyx2bk", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Raat ke 3 baje… sab kuch hai, bas neend nahi 🌙\n\nEk chor aaya jo kabhi dikha nahi. Bas ek mor-pankh, aur farsh pe chhote neele pairon ke nishaan.\nNaam le gaya, kaam le gaya, Ram aur Shyam bhi. Aur har cheez ke jaate hi saans thodi halki hoti gayi.\nPhir pata chala, yeh poora shehar toh bas ek parda tha… aur uske peeche chandni raat thi, kamal khil rahe the.\n\n🎵 Chor · @i.justh \n\nUsko bhejo jiske paas sab kuch hai, phir bhi neend nahi aati 💙\n\n#Chor #Justh #Chitchor", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793803579, "like_count": 7845, "comment_count": 14, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4412841198939929a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.919, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMdJN9AqpRgeTmKXtVVeDj1YfNo34jEfQwPYf3Dl46Qi8OgrPEHfwadjRAZZSNXpLMoi0-I7C5KOmwnd4Pv6R7PSyK8vdjiPaB7utw.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdrfzZccQIy-3U_cdv-GyUdulYN5MoFeHtkmPTt6OgafegmFwx73BCZtfAo5IObALdw__0uN51-G2mwyV5qGBz9O&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=19pYota4G9cQ7kNvwFYzcnt&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=kQbbq_BkHZi6nHBxvmqyHw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQ79PS1bPMMUL4551aRIx3aF_-g4vkoiUg-owjNdePSxA&oe=6AF44AE2", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 64.919, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTM